    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Short answer: ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "No, you don’t always need a non-conditional offer first.",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " It depends on the scholarship.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "How it usually works for separate-application scholarships like Chevening:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "1. Chevening, Commonwealth, DAAD, etc.",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "You apply to the scholarship AND to universities separately",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- For Chevening specifically: You need 2 university offers by July, but they can be ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "conditional",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " at the time you apply.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- You don’t need to have an offer when you first submit the Chevening application in Nov.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "2. University-specific scholarships",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- Some require you to already have an offer: \"Apply for admission first, then apply for scholarship\"",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- Some let you apply at the same time: \"Tick the scholarship box on your admission form\"",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "- Some are automatic: \"No separate application, they consider everyone admitted\"",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The pattern:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "**Scholarship Type**\t",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Offer Needed to Apply?",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "bold"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Chevening, Fulbright, AA\tNo. Apply in parallel",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Gates Cambridge, Rhodes\tYes. Strongly preferred to have offer/interview",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Most university merit scholarships\tVaries. Some yes, some no",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Key tip:",
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": " \"Non-conditional\" usually isn't required at application stage. Conditional is fine. You just need to meet the conditions and have an unconditional offer before the scholarship starts.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Are you asking about Chevening specifically, or other ones too? I can check the exact 2026 deadlines and requirements for you if you tell me the country/course you’re targeting.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
